<title>USA: Intervisual Books president, CEO to resign.</title>
<headline>Intervisual Books president, CEO to resign.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intervisual Books Inc said President and Chief Executive Officer Charles Gates will resign effective November 15 to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>The company said Chairman Waldo Hunt will assume his duties until a successor is named.</p>
